  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2 x plus 3\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p>For the given function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane is parallel to line <math alttext=\"j\"><mi>j</mi>\n</math>. What is the slope of line <math alttext=\"j\"><mi>j</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
